            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent served with big corn chips. I have made this before. AKA \"poor mans caviar\". Took this to work for a pot luck dinner, Had NONE to bring home. It is soooo easy! thanks kimber!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AANLA"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe.. and to argue a point with a previous reviewer I think it needed MORE peas which I added. I took it to a party and it was gone super fast. Thanks",
            "datePublished": "2008-03-07T12:29:07.917Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Erimess"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Maybe I need to be from the south to get it, but I wasn't thrilled with this. I tried it by itself as a side dish, and with tortilla chips as a dip (as another reader used it). It seemed all I could taste was this bland bean taste, as though I were just eating a can of beans by itself. Doesn't make sense considering all the flavorful ingredients, but there it is.",
            "datePublished": "2004-02-16T18:22:07.500Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa Avery Croff"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummmy!!!!!! I can't believe how good this recipe tasted! I made it as a part of a big spread for a party. People could not leave it alone, including myself. I have already transferred this one into my permanent book. Thanks Kimber!",
            "datePublished": "2004-01-14T08:36:52.747Z"
